= \underline{c} + \underline{0}
\therefore \underline{a} + \underline{b} = \underline{c}
\therefore \text{ Ikiwa } \underline{a} + \underline{b} = \underline{c} \text{ basi, } \underline{a} = \underline{c} - \underline{b} \text{ na kinyume chake. (Imeonyeshwa)}

